    "body": "> Why is it not possible to queue these tasks on the dissimilar origin global task source, once the port itself is transferred to a dissimilar origin realm?\r\n\r\nHixie gives motivation for that in https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=15063#c2\r\n\r\nI'm not sure how well that implementation strategy maps to actual implementations in browsers though.\r\n\r\n> And how does the unshipped port message queue come into play here?\r\n\r\nI don't follow what you are asking here. Can you clarify what the scenario is?",
